  2	 * @file `media` write/read service (ADR-027) — walking-skeleton build.
  3	 *
  4	 * Mirrors `src/features/post/post.ts`'s shape: plain async functions taking
  5	 * `{ deps, input }` (+ an optional second `options` object), typed domain
  6	 * errors from `./types`.
  7	 *
  8	 * SCOPE — what this file deliberately does NOT build (disclosed, not silently
  9	 * skipped; each deferred piece is named in ADR-027 itself):
