 28	 *     `/m/{assetId}/{transformName}.v{version}/{slug}.{ext}` URL contract.
 29	 *  3. **Origin-isolated serving** — there is no HTTP route in this build that
 30	 *     serves media bytes at all (the admin UI shows filenames, not thumbnails
