 90	 * `source.sha256`: absent -> set exactly once, then immutable.
 91	 *
 92	 * Not currently reachable through any exposed write path — `uploadMedia` only
 93	 * ever calls it with `existing = undefined` (a brand-new row), and
 94	 * `UpdateMediaMetadataInput` has no `sha256` field at all, so
